\flow{d}{e}{\Tx{S上の非零fiber値を持ち上げ、例外的な正補正を降下させる。}{Lift a nonzero fiber value on S; descend the exceptional positive correction.}\\[3pt]\Cite{kv-vanishing}\\[3pt]\Cite{lifting}\\[3pt]\Cite{descent}};
